# Pagoda Rain, by Claude & SZ. An original ambient piece for the Ambient style, after the music
# in the Pagoda Garden toy: a washed pad and a soft sub that change chord every 15 seconds
# (Dmaj9, Bm7, Gmaj7, Aadd9, four bars each at 64 BPM), sparse music-box notes picked from each
# chord, a slow Rhodes phrase in the middle, and the style's bed of air under everything. Made
# to loop: it ends on the chord before the first one, so repeat runs straight back in.
# chords: Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Bm7 Bm7 Bm7 Bm7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Aadd9 Aadd9 Aadd9 Aadd9
# chords @17: Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Bm7 Bm7 Bm7 Bm7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Aadd9 Aadd9 Aadd9 Aadd9
# chords @33: Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Bm7 Bm7 Bm7 Bm7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Aadd9 Aadd9 Aadd9 Aadd9
# chords @49: Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Bm7 Bm7 Bm7 Bm7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Aadd9 Aadd9 Aadd9 Aadd9
# chords @65: Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Bm7 Bm7 Bm7 Bm7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Aadd9 Aadd9 Aadd9 Aadd9
# chords @81: Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Bm7 Bm7 Bm7 Bm7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Aadd9 Aadd9 Aadd9 Aadd9
# chords @97: Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Bm7 Bm7 Bm7 Bm7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Aadd9 Aadd9 Aadd9 Aadd9
# chords @113: Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Dmaj9 Bm7 Bm7 Bm7 Bm7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Gmaj7 Aadd9 Aadd9 Aadd9 Aadd9
# Form 1-32: open - pad and sub drift in; sparse music box
# Form 33-64: keys - a slow Rhodes phrase on each chord
# Form 65-96: glass - the glass pad rises; busier music box
# Form 97-128: settle - back to the pad, the sub and a few notes
title: Pagoda Rain
composer: Claude & SZ
year: 2026
source: original
category: originals
style: ambient
key: D major
tempo: 64
time: 4/4
about: A slow drift for rainy days: a washed pad changing chord every fifteen seconds, a music box picking notes out of it, and a bed of air underneath. Loops cleanly; turn on repeat for endless play.

